# ============================================================================
# common/structural/placement — FROZEN PlacementRequest / PlacementPlan /
# lease-rules contract (PLACE lane)
#
# Architecture §20 (GPU Object VM and placement), §26 (contract freeze), §27
# (PLACE lane). Contract document:
# doc/05_design/platform/structural_compute/placement_contract_v1.md
#
# The semantic carriers this group encodes live in
# src/lib/common/compute/placement_contracts/ and are NOT re-exported here —
# importing them from two places is how a lane ends up with two spellings of
# one type.
#
# Explicit re-exports only — no `export use *`, which the linter flags for
# exposing unnecessary interface.
# ============================================================================

